  "title": "Cracklin' Bread I",
  "description": "This Southern bread features an unique combination of ingredients: pork, onion, orange juice, buttermilk and just a little honey. They all bake in a skillet with pork fat.",
  "authors": [
    "Dee"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-09-29T16:55:41-04:00",
